{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Logic-only NPC behaviors: roaming, theft, canned reactions. The plugin"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"owns no entities and no state — position "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"is","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" the actor’s placement —"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so the host declares its actors and splices these factories into its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"own ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"timers"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rules"},{"text":" blocks:","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ActorBehaviors","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let actors = ActorBehaviors()","","var timers: [TimedEvent] {","    actors.roams(thief, daemonName: \"thief.roam\",","                 rooms: [cellar, gallery, studio])","    actors.steals(thief, daemonName: \"thief.steal\",","                  candidates: [painting],","                  announcement: { \"A shadow relieves you of the \\($0).\" })","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Every random decision draws from the game’s seeded stream, and draws","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"happen "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"only after"}]},{"text":" a factory’s guards pass — a daemon whose actor is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"out of position (or whose player has nothing worth taking) consumes no","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"randomness, so transcripts that never meet the actor stay stable no","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"matter what he does elsewhere."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"None of these daemons acts for an actor whose ","type":"text"},{"code":"Actor.isUnconscious","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"set."}]},{"type":"text","text":" A man lying on the floor does not wander off, catch you up, or lift"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"anything out of your hands, and he draws no randomness deciding not to."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"That flag is the engine’s rather than this plugin’s for a reason worth"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"knowing: what usually puts a villain down is a combat plugin, and two"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"plugins cannot see each other. "},{"code":"GnustoMeleeCombat","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" sets it and this one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"reads it, without either library knowing the other exists.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/init()"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/follows(_:daemonName:rooms:while:arrivals:)","doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/reaction(of:to:reply:)","doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/roams(_:daemonName:rooms:chancePerTurn:while:arrival:departure:)","doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/steals(_:daemonName:candidates:chancePerTurn:announcement:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/GamePlugin-Implementations"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/init()"],"title":"The plugin","generated":true,"anchor":"The-plugin"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:12GnustoActors14ActorBehaviorsV","modules":[{"name":"GnustoActors"}],"title":"ActorBehaviors","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ActorBehaviors","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ActorBehaviors"}]},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin","doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"references":{"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors":{"kind":"symbol","title":"GnustoActors","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors","abstract":[{"text":"Daemons that make an NPC wander, tag along, or go through your pockets.","type":"text"}]},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors/roams(_:daemonName:rooms:chancePerTurn:while:arrival:departure:)":{"kind":"symbol","title":"roams(_:daemonName:rooms:chancePerTurn:while:arrival:departure:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/roams(_:daemonName:rooms:chancePerTurn:while:arrival:departure:)","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/roams(_:daemonname:rooms:chanceperturn:while:arrival:departure:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"roams","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Actor","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"text":"daemonName","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"rooms"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Location","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8LocationV"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"text":"chancePerTurn","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"while","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": () -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"arrival","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"text":"departure","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"?) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TimedEvent","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A daemon that, with "},{"code":"chancePerTurn","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", moves ","type":"text"},{"code":"actor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to a random","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"other","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" room in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rooms"},{"type":"text","text":" — a teleport within the set, with no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"exit-graph awareness (a wall between two rooms in the set won’t","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stop him). Arrival\/departure lines print only when the player’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"room is lit and is the room being entered or left: in the dark, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a room away, movement is silent. The daemon idles (no RNG drawn)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"while the actor is outside "},{"code":"rooms","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — including after ","type":"text"},{"code":"vanish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"but the host should still ","type":"text"},{"code":"stopDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on the actor’s death."}]},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors/steals(_:daemonName:candidates:chancePerTurn:announcement:)":{"title":"steals(_:daemonName:candidates:chancePerTurn:announcement:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A daemon that, when ","type":"text"},{"code":"actor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" shares the player’s room, rolls","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"chancePerTurn"},{"type":"text","text":" and moves one random "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"reachable"}]},{"type":"text","text":" item from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"candidates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"into the actor’s inventory, announcing it with the stolen item’s name."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Like the original’s thief, the actor lifts a candidate from wherever it"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lies in the shared room: out of the player’s hands, off the floor, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"from inside anything open — a sack, a trophy case, a table top — to any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"depth. Only another actor’s hands are beyond reach. The theft is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"announced only when the player’s room is lit: in the dark you find out","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when you check your pockets.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"steals","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"Actor","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"daemonName","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"candidates"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Item","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto4ItemV"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"chancePerTurn"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"announcement","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TimedEvent","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/steals(_:daemonname:candidates:chanceperturn:announcement:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/steals(_:daemonName:candidates:chancePerTurn:announcement:)","type":"topic"},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors/reaction(of:to:reply:)":{"kind":"symbol","title":"reaction(of:to:reply:)","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/reaction(of:to:reply:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/reaction(of:to:reply:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reaction"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"of"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Actor"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"to"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto6IntentV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Intent"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"reply"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Rules","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5RulesV"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A canned reply when any of the named intents target the actor —","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"“talk to troll”, “give sword to troll”, whatever the host’s verbs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"emit. One line, before-phase, ends the turn.","type":"text"}]},"doc://GnustoActors/s8SendableP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/s8SendableP","title":"Swift.Sendable"},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors":{"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ActorBehaviors","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"ActorBehaviors","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ActorBehaviors"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Logic-only NPC behaviors: roaming, theft, canned reactions. The plugin","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"owns no entities and no state — position "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"is"}]},{"text":" the actor’s placement —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so the host declares its actors and splices these factories into its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"own ","type":"text"},{"code":"timers","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rules"},{"type":"text","text":" blocks:"}]},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/GamePlugin":{"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GamePlugin","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"GamePlugin","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GamePlugin","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/gameplugin","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"GamePlugin","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A reusable game system — commerce, combat, dialog, magic — packaged as an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"importable unit of ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"verbs","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"rules","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", that a host game opts into.","type":"text"}]},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors/init()":{"kind":"symbol","title":"init()","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/init()","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/init()","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Creates the plugin.","type":"text"}]},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors/GamePlugin-Implementations":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/gameplugin-implementations","title":"GamePlugin Implementations","abstract":[],"kind":"article","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/GamePlugin-Implementations","role":"collectionGroup"},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors/follows(_:daemonName:rooms:while:arrivals:)":{"title":"follows(_:daemonName:rooms:while:arrivals:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A daemon that keeps ","type":"text"},{"code":"actor","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in the player’s room: each turn, if the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"actor is onstage but elsewhere, it teleports to wherever the player"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"now stands. Daemons tick at the end of the turn, after the player’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"go","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has resolved and the new room is described, so the companion","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"catches up the same turn and its "},{"code":"arrival","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" line trails the room"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"description. The line prints only when the destination is lit: in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the dark the companion arrives unseen. There is deliberately no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"departure"},{"type":"text","text":" line — the companion only ever moves "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"to"}]},{"type":"text","text":" the player,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so no one is ever in the room it leaves to watch it go (unlike"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"roams","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"). The daemon idles while the actor is offstage — including"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vanish()"},{"type":"text","text":" — and the host may "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stopDaemon(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" to park the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"companion for a “wait here” beat, then "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"startDaemon(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" to resume."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It draws no randomness at all (unlike "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"roams"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"steals"},{"type":"text","text":"), so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"following companion never perturbs the seeded stream: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"arrivals"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cycled by the saved turn counter, so the line varies from arrival to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arrival yet stays deterministic across save and restore. Pass one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"line for a fixed announcement, a dozen so a constant companion does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not wear his welcome out. Start the companion co-located with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"player ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"starts(in:)"},{"type":"text","text":" the player’s start room) to avoid a spurious"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arrival on turn one."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"follows"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","text":"Actor"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"daemonName"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"rooms"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"text":"Location","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8LocationV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"while","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"arrivals","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"]) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TimedEvent","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/follows(_:daemonname:rooms:while:arrivals:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/follows(_:daemonName:rooms:while:arrivals:)","type":"topic"},"doc://GnustoActors/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/s16SendableMetatypeP","type":"unresolvable"}}}